#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:6
msgid "$trim"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$trim(text[,character])**"
msgstr "用法：**$trim(text[,character])**"

#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:9
msgid "Category: text"
msgstr "类别：文本"

#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:11
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_trim.rst:13
msgid "Trims all leading and trailing whitespaces from ``text``. The optional second parameter ``character`` specifies the character to trim. If multiple characters are provided in ``character``, each character will be applied separately to the function."
msgstr ""
"从 ``text`` 中修剪所有前导和尾随空白。可选的第二参数 ``character`` 指定要修剪"
"的字符。如果 ``character`` 中提供多个字符，每个字符将分别应用于函数。"

